Directory contents:
ant-contrib-1.0b3.jar:
 from: http://ant-contrib.sourceforge.net/
deployment-ant-pack200-1.0beta.jar:
 from https://deployment.dev.java.net
junit-platform-console-standalone-6.1.3.jar:
 from https://junit.org/ (Maven Central)
jdoctest/jdoctest-2.1.jar, jdoctest/rhino-all-1.9.2.jar:
 from https://cscott.net/Projects/JDoctest (Maven Central)
antlr3-ant.jar:
 from: http://fisheye2.atlassian.com/browse/antlr-buildtools
 specifically:
  http://fisheye2.atlassian.com/browse/~raw,r=5375/antlr-buildtools/ant/antlr-ant/main/antlr3-task/antlr3.jar
jacoco-0.8.16/jacocoant.jar (org.jacoco.ant-0.8.16-nodeps.jar):
 from https://www.jacoco.org/jacoco/ (Maven Central)
jline-0.9.94.jar:
 from https://jline.github.io/ (only for run-shell.sh; Rhino's shell
 doesn't know jline 3+, and PMSD uses lib/jline-4.4.8.jar)
antlr-complete-3.5.3.jar (and ../antlr-runtime-3.5.3.jar):
 from https://www.antlr3.org/ (Maven Central)
jakarta.servlet-api-6.0.0.jar:
 from https://jakarta.ee/specifications/servlet/ (Maven Central); only to
 compile the web UI's servlet, as the servlet container provides it
package-lists/*/package-list:
 javadoc package lists for linking to the docs of jars in lib/, made with
  for j in JARS; do unzip -Z1 $j; done | grep '\.class$' | grep -v '^META-INF' \
    | sed 's#/[^/]*$##' | grep / | tr / . | sort -u
 from lib/sphinx/sphinx4.jar, lib/jme/jme*.jar and lib/jutil.jar.
